@lang en
IMPORT `tasco-claims`



§ `Fixtures for the definitions and Chương II tests`

`a load 50% over, for Chương II` MEANS `The load at the time of the loss` WITH
    `permitted load`                                          IS 1_000
    `load carried, towed or lifted`                           IS 1_500
    `permitted number of people`                              IS 5
    `number of people carried, not counting children under 7` IS 4

`an overloaded goods vehicle on the road` MEANS `The circumstances of the loss` WITH
    `intentional damage by an excluded person`               IS FALSE
    `in road traffic`                                        IS TRUE
    `inspection certificate`                                 IS `valid and in force`
    `driver`                                                 IS `a sober licensed driver`
    `special equipment operated without the required permit` IS FALSE
    `way the vehicle was driven`                             IS `lawful driving`
    `racing, lawful or not`                                  IS FALSE
    `towing another vehicle unlawfully`                      IS FALSE
    `carrying goods unlawfully`                              IS FALSE
    `carrying explosives or flammable substances`            IS FALSE
    `outside Vietnam`                                        IS FALSE
    `war or terrorism`                                       IS FALSE
    `vandalism in a protest, riot or public disorder`        IS FALSE
    `bombs, mines or explosive devices`                      IS FALSE
    `load`                                                   IS `a load 50% over, for Chương II`
    `speed`                                                  IS `no speed finding`

`a used car imported in 2024, made in 2015` MEANS `A vehicle` WITH
    `kind of vehicle`                        IS `a car`
    `propulsion`                             IS `an internal combustion engine only`
    `what it carries`                        IS `people only`
    `used for business`                      IS FALSE
    `number of seats`                        IS 5
    `month of first registration in Vietnam` IS `May 2021`
    `imported having been used abroad`       IS TRUE
    `year of manufacture`                    IS 2_015

`a trailer drawn by a tractor` MEANS `A vehicle` WITH
    `kind of vehicle`                        IS `a trailer or semi-trailer drawn by a car or a tractor`
    `propulsion`                             IS `an internal combustion engine only`
    `what it carries`                        IS `people only`
    `used for business`                      IS FALSE
    `number of seats`                        IS 5
    `month of first registration in Vietnam` IS `May 2021`
    `imported having been used abroad`       IS FALSE
    `year of manufacture`                    IS 2_021

`a motorcycle` MEANS `A vehicle` WITH
    `kind of vehicle`                        IS `a vehicle of another kind`
    `propulsion`                             IS `an internal combustion engine only`
    `what it carries`                        IS `people only`
    `used for business`                      IS FALSE
    `number of seats`                        IS 5
    `month of first registration in Vietnam` IS `May 2021`
    `imported having been used abroad`       IS FALSE
    `year of manufacture`                    IS 2_021

`cover of 400 million on a car worth 500 million` MEANS `The physical damage cover` WITH
    `sum insured`                                  IS 400_000_000
    `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 500_000_000
    `deductible stated on the certificate`         IS NOTHING
    `additional clauses held`                      IS EMPTY
    `insurance period in months`                   IS 12

`cover of 600 million on a car worth 500 million` MEANS `The physical damage cover` WITH
    `sum insured`                                  IS 600_000_000
    `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 500_000_000
    `deductible stated on the certificate`         IS NOTHING
    `additional clauses held`                      IS EMPTY
    `insurance period in months`                   IS 12

`cover with a deductible of 10 million` MEANS `The physical damage cover` WITH
    `sum insured`                                  IS 500_000_000
    `market value when the contract was concluded` IS 500_000_000
    `deductible stated on the certificate`         IS JUST 10_000_000
    `additional clauses held`                      IS EMPTY
    `insurance period in months`                   IS 12

