`the fact for 15.1` MEANS `The facts for the physical damage exclusions` WITH
    `wear and tear, inherent vice, loss of commercial value, defect, or damage from repair`       IS TRUE
    `water hammer in the combustion engine from operating in flood water`                         IS FALSE
    `electric motor of an electric car damaged by operating in flood water`                       IS FALSE
    `only tyres, tarpaulins or badges damaged, nothing else by the same cause in the accident`    IS FALSE
    `whole vehicle lost by fraud or abuse of trust`                                               IS FALSE
    `electrical damage by overload, overpressure, short circuit, self-heating, arcing or leakage` IS FALSE
    `loss of equipment fitted beyond the manufacturer's, not protective and not permitted`        IS FALSE
    `loss caused by such added equipment`                                                         IS FALSE
    `loss caused by the operation of the vehicle's own special equipment`                         IS FALSE
    `damage by the goods carried, not from a collision or overturning`                            IS FALSE

`a collision with the fact for 15.1` MEANS `A loss to the vehicle` WITH
    `date of the loss`                                                        IS YMD 2024 9 1
    `cause of the damage`                                                     IS `collision, overturning, sinking, falling, or impact by an external object`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                   IS TRUE
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `circumstances`                                                           IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `exclusion facts`                                                         IS `the fact for 15.1`
    `damage`                                                                  IS `bumper and door damage`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                  IS `prompt and honest conduct`

