`malicious damage by a stranger` MEANS `A loss to the vehicle` WITH
    `date of the loss`                                                        IS YMD 2024 9 1
    `cause of the damage`                                                     IS `malicious damage by a third party`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                   IS TRUE
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `circumstances`                                                           IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `exclusion facts`                                                         IS `no specific exclusion facts`
    `damage`                                                                  IS `bumper and door damage`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                  IS `prompt and honest conduct`

`malicious damage by a passenger` MEANS `A loss to the vehicle` WITH
    `date of the loss`                                                        IS YMD 2024 9 1
    `cause of the damage`                                                     IS `malicious damage by a third party`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                   IS TRUE
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS TRUE
    `circumstances`                                                           IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `exclusion facts`                                                         IS `no specific exclusion facts`
    `damage`                                                                  IS `bumper and door damage`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                  IS `prompt and honest conduct`

`a loss from an unlisted cause` MEANS `A loss to the vehicle` WITH
    `date of the loss`                                                        IS YMD 2024 9 1
    `cause of the damage`                                                     IS `a cause not listed in art 14.1`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                   IS TRUE
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `circumstances`                                                           IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `exclusion facts`                                                         IS `no specific exclusion facts`
    `damage`                                                                  IS `bumper and door damage`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                  IS `prompt and honest conduct`

`a theft of the whole vehicle` MEANS `A loss to the vehicle` WITH
    `date of the loss`                                                        IS YMD 2024 9 1
    `cause of the damage`                                                     IS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                   IS TRUE
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `circumstances`                                                           IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `exclusion facts`                                                         IS `no specific exclusion facts`
    `damage`                                                                  IS `bumper and door damage`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                  IS `prompt and honest conduct`

-- Definitions and Chương II tests. Expected values are worked from the source by hand, with the
-- arithmetic beside each group; the 36 table assertions are generated from the page transcription.

§ `Definitions`

-- Opening paragraph: cars, tractors, trailers drawn by them; nothing else.
#ASSERT `the rules apply to` `a private car registered in May 2021`
#ASSERT `the rules apply to` `a trailer drawn by a tractor`
#ASSERT NOT `the rules apply to` `a motorcycle`
#ASSERT `the date the rules took effect` EQUALS YMD 2024 5 22
#ASSERT `the rules had taken effect on` (YMD 2024 5 22)
#ASSERT NOT `the rules had taken effect on` (YMD 2024 5 21)
-- Definition 5.
#ASSERT `a person with this relation is the owner` `lawfully possesses and uses it, entrusted by the owner`
#ASSERT NOT `a person with this relation is the owner` `none of these`
-- Definition 7: May 2021 to June 2024 is 37 months; an imported used car made in 2015 counts from
-- January 2015: (2024 x 12 + 6) - (2015 x 12 + 1) = 113.
#ASSERT `the months of use of` `a private car registered in May 2021` `at a contract concluded on` (YMD 2024 6 1) EQUALS 37
#ASSERT `the months of use of` `a used car imported in 2024, made in 2015` `at a contract concluded on` (YMD 2024 6 1) EQUALS 113
-- Definitions 9, 10, 15, 19.
#ASSERT `the buyer is deemed to have agreed to the certificate` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the buyer is deemed to have agreed to the certificate` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the certificate evidences the contract` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the certificate evidences the contract` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the vehicle was in operation` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle was in operation` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the collisions are one accident` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the collisions are one accident` TRUE FALSE

§ `Điều 14 — the perils and the costs`

#ASSERT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a collision on 1 September 2024`
#ASSERT NOT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a collision not sudden`
#ASSERT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a natural catastrophe`
#ASSERT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a theft of the whole vehicle`
#ASSERT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `malicious damage by a stranger`
#ASSERT NOT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `malicious damage by a passenger`
#ASSERT NOT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a theft of parts`
#ASSERT NOT `art 14.1 — the loss is within the insured perils` `a loss from an unlisted cause`
-- 14.2: 1,000,000 + 3,000,000; towing at 60 million is capped at 10% of 500 million.
#ASSERT `art 14.2 — the costs payable besides the compensation` `cover of 500 million at full value` `bumper and door damage` EQUALS 4_000_000
#ASSERT `art 14.2 — the costs payable besides the compensation` `cover of 500 million at full value` `bumper and door damage, towing at 60 million` EQUALS 51_000_000
#ASSERT `art 14 — capped at the sum insured` `cover of 500 million at full value` 600_000_000 EQUALS 500_000_000

§ `Điều 15 — each exclusion with a case that fires it; the ordinary collision as the near miss`

#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision on 1 September 2024` `people only` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a theft of parts` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.4 theft of parts`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with a load 50% over` `goods only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.7 overload of 50% or more`
#ASSERT `art 11 and 15 — the exclusions that apply to the physical damage claim` `a collision with a load 50% over` `goods only` EQUALS LIST `art 11.10 overload of 50% or more`, `art 15.7 overload of 50% or more`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.1` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.1 wear, defect or repair`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.2` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.2 EV` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.3` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.3 tyres, tarpaulins or badges alone`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.5` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.5 fraud or abuse of trust`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.6` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.6 electrical damage`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.8` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.8 added equipment`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.8 caused` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.8 added equipment`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.9` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.9 own special equipment`
#ASSERT `art 15 — the physical damage exclusions that apply` `a collision with the fact for 15.10` `people only` EQUALS LIST `art 15.10 damage by the goods carried`

§ `Điều 16 — the sum insured`

